{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BJnTVfAguoDV7FVUfkqaXB","type":"tool_result","content":"/**\n * Inject bundle sizes (as measured by size-limit) into README.md.\n * Measures whatever is in dist, so build before running.\n */\nimport { execSync } from 'node:child_process'\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs'\n\nconst MARKERS:[string, string, string][] = [\n    ['microtags', '<!-- size -->', '<!-- /size -->'],\n    ['microtags/htm', '<!-- size:htm -->', '<!-- /size:htm -->'],\n]\n\nconst json = execSync('size-limit --json', { encoding: 'utf8' })\nconst results:Array<{ name:string; size:number }> = JSON.parse(json)\n\nlet readme = readFileSync('README.md', 'utf8')\n\nfor (const [name, start, end] of MARKERS) {\n    const entry = results.find(r => r.name === name)\n    if (!entry) {\n        throw new Error(\n            `size-limit returned no result for \"${name}\"`\n        )\n    }\n\n    const pattern = new RegExp(\n        `${escapeRe(start)}[\\\\s\\\\S]*?${escapeRe(end)}`\n    )\n\n    if (!pattern.test(readme)) {\n        throw new Error(\n            'README.md is missing the '\n            + `\"${start} ... ${end}\" markers`\n        )\n    }\n\n    const value = `${(entry.size / 1000).toFixed(2)} KB`\n    readme = readme.replace(\n        pattern,\n        `${start}${value}${end}`\n    )\n    process.stdout.write(\n        `Injected ${name} size ${value} into README.md\\n`\n    )\n}\n\nwriteFileSync('README.md', readme)\n\nfunction escapeRe (s:string):string {\n    return s.replace(/[.*+?^${}()|[\\]\\\\]/g, '\\\\$&')\n}\n// .size-limit.js\nexport default [\n    {\n        name: 'microtags',\n        path: 'dist/index.min.js',\n        // measured 3.96 kB with server render support moved out of\n        // core (ADR-009) and the typed bind helper; 3.99 kB with the\n        // renderParts static, rounded up to the next 0.05 kB\n        limit: '4 kB',\n    },\n    {\n        name: 'microtags/htm',\n        path: 'dist/htm.min.js',\n        limit: '5 kB',\n    },\n    {\n        name: 'microtags/htm (browser)',\n        path: 'dist/htm.browser.min.js',\n        // measured 4.77 kB after the guarded moveBefore, the duplicate\n        // key check, raw() span adoption, the Markup brand symbol and\n        // the void-element children check; 4.82 kB after the\n        // attribute name guard; 4.94 kB with form controls bound as\n        // DOM properties; 4.99 kB with the adoption mismatch\n        // lookahead; 5.25 kB carrying the server render support\n        // module (ADR-009); 5.29 kB with adopted controls compared\n        // against the server value; 5.31 kB with the lookahead held\n        // inside its range; 5.39 kB with render support building the\n        // host tag from render parts, rounded up to the next 0.05 kB\n        limit: '5.4 kB',\n    },\n    {\n        name: 'microtags/preact (browser)',\n        path: 'dist/preact.browser.min.js',\n        // measures the adapter alone (preact is a peer); measured\n        // 443 B, rounded up to the next 0.05 kB\n        ignore: ['preact'],\n        limit: '450 B',\n    },\n]\n1:# microtags\n22:| `microtags/htm` | <!-- size:htm -->1.23 KB<!-- /size:htm --> |\n28:- [Install](#install)\n31:- [Get Started](#get-started)\n35:- [Full Example](#full-example)\n36:- [Validation](#validation)\n40:- [Serverside Example](#serverside-example)\n43:- [Hydration](#hydration)\n44:- [API](#api)\n59:- [Missing refs](#missing-refs)\n61:- [Typed Events](#typed-events)\n62:- [Templates](#templates)\n63:- [Subpath Exports](#subpath-exports)\n82:- [Differences from `nanotags`](#differences-from-nanotags)\n95:## Install\n101:### Import map\n124:### Pre-bundled\n139:## Get Started\n141:### 1. Call `.define`\n151:### 2. Call the `.with*` Methods\n170:### 3. Call `.setup`\n209:## Full Example\n279:## Validation\n292:### Prop validation\n328:#### `p.schema` vs Standard Schema\n367:### Client-side validation\n433:## Serverside Example